Templates that conflict on a list's item and on a nested value.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/app
apply: [ a.module-template.yaml, b.module-template.yaml, c.module-template.yaml ]
--- a.module-template.yaml
settings:
  jvm:
    mainClass: a.MainKt
--- b.module-template.yaml
settings:
  jvm:
    mainClass: b.MainKt
--- c.module-template.yaml
settings:
  jvm:
    mainClass: a.MainKt
--- expected
ERROR: Conflicting values for property `mainClass` in context [module.yaml]:\n  - `a.MainKt`, defined at:\n    ├─ a.module-template.yaml:3:16\n    ╰─ c.module-template.yaml:3:16\n  - `b.MainKt`, defined at:\n    ╰─ b.module-template.yaml:3:16
